        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Galicia, Spain, La Palma, Canary Islands, Santiago de Compostela, Praza do Obradoiro, Santa Uxía de Ribeira\n- Organizations: Atlantic Islands of Galicia National Park, Caldera de Taburiente National Park\n- Places: Sálvora, Hostal dos Reis Católicos\n- Products: Parador hotels\n\nFacts:\n- The Atlantic Islands of Galicia National Park is the only national park in the autonomous community of Galicia, Spain.\n- Caldera de Taburiente National Park is a large geological feature on the island of La Palma in the Canary Islands, Spain.\n- Sálvora belongs to the municipality of Santa Uxía de Ribeira and is part of the Atlantic Islands of Galicia National Park.\n- The Hostal dos Reis Católicos, also called the Hostal de Los Reyes Católicos or Parador de Santiago, is a 5-star Parador hotel in the Praza do Obradoiro, Santiago de Compostela, Galicia, Spain.",
